iption-usage normalizer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its PyO3 binding, and the indicator arm that classifies Muse's weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]window as a weekly all-model window.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Free echo-mint usage probe[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]collector[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-normalizer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]collector: add the Python MSP probe that mints a Muse usage observation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with no model call, wire the provider usage hooks, and move the pinned [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]core revision and sase-core-rs floor forward so the new binding is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guaranteed present.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Default header indicator policy[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]indicator-default[dim] · [dim][/dim]after collector[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]indicator-default: ship default config that shows only Muse's weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]window in the TUI header usage cluster, document it, and verify the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendered result.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-14c","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-14c.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-959d5561f9549b8332093721c37ac0b6","started_at":"2026-09-20T16:43:06.941326+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9a5720d49253903145d92b94d1ac2a2466e973dc0ea73806bd0918966bf9f042","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-14c.land/chat.md","size_bytes":8629},"commits":{